# Keep local credentials, data and development artifacts out of image builds.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/secrets/
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.crt
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.dump
**/*.sql.gz
**/uploads/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov/
**/*.log
**/.git/
